<h2>Air freight vs. sea freight</h2>
<p>Air freight is the default for premium UK mango. Alphonso has a short shelf life once ripe, and air freight keeps the freshness that justifies the retail premium. Sea freight in reefer containers suits buyers with larger volumes and more tolerance for transit time, and it needs much tighter ripeness management. This choice shapes almost everything else in the quote: cost, ripeness handling, and how much volume makes commercial sense.</p>
